<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Search for fence cost in Dallas and you will not find one agreed number. One DFW firm publishes $15-$30 per linear foot for wood privacy fence installation, while Ergeon's Dallas County page lists wood fence at $38-$48 per foot installed. The gap is real, and it comes from what is in the price, the wood, the height and who is quoting.</p><p>White Rock Fence Co is advertising that connects Dallas homeowners with independent fence contractors. It does not build fences or give quotes. Every figure below is what one named firm advertises, or a national guide labeled as national, read in October 2026. To get a real number for your yard, call (214) 555-0137 and ask to be put in touch with a contractor who will quote the job in writing, then collect two or three comparable quotes.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 56px;"><div style="max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;">
