          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#555;">DFW Fence Contractor also lists premium or custom board-on-board at $60-$90+ per foot.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#2F3438;font-weight:500;">8 ft privacy fence</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#2A3035;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">$4,500-$12,750 for 150 ft (Fixr, national)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#555;">National total only. No Dallas firm's 8 ft per-foot price was found.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#2F3438;font-weight:500;">Iron or ornamental steel fence, per foot</td>
