          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#2A3035;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">$18-$22 (Ergeon, Dallas)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#555;">One firm's Dallas page. Gates and posts may be extra.</td>
