          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#2A3035;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">$3,500-$10,000 for most Dallas-area installs (TX Fence & Deck); $2,500-$5,500 (Fixr, national)</td>
          <td style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #E3DFD8;color:#555;">Power to a remote gate can add $500-$2,000, that firm says.</td>
        </tr>
        </tbody>
